00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:06.180
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Our
next lab on Qwiklabs

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.280
is Google Cloud
Datalab Qwik Start.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:11.130
Cloud Datalab is an interactive
data analysis and machine

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.830
learning environment designed
for Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:17.040
You can use it to explore,
analyze, transform,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.110
and visualize your
data interactively,

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.570
and to build machine learning
models from your data.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.030
In the lab you'll create a
cloud Datalab instance, called

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.240
My Datalab, and use Web Preview
to access the Datalab home

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.140
page.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.750
Then you'll create a new
notebook, run the code,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.080
and save the notebook.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.489
You'll use get an unget
for source control.

00:00:34.489 --> 00:00:36.030
If you've been
following these videos

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:37.810
and completing these
Qwiklabs in order,

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.270
you're almost done
with this quest.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.100
Only two more labs to
go, and the next one

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.120
is Cloud ML Engine--

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:42.894
Qwik Start.

00:00:42.894 --> 00:00:44.310
This lab is part
of the Baseline--

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.119
Data, ML, and AI
quest on Qwiklabs.

00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:48.660
Completing all the
labs in this quest

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.134
earns you this badge to
recognize your new skills.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.550
You can show off your badge
on your resume or social media

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.100
channels.

